WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.190
A colleague showed me a free

2
00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.770
quiz app last week.

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.740
The pupils loved it.

4
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.260
Then I read what it asks for: their

5
00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:13.080
location, their contacts and the

6
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:13.640
microphone.

7
00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.130
For a quiz?

8
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.680
Today: how to check an app or an AI tool

9
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.300
before you use it with a class.

10
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.400
Before you use any app with

11
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.320
pupils, ask four questions.

12
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:27.790
Who makes it?

13
00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.790
What data does it take?

14
00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.960
How old must users be?

15
00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:33.830
And what can you switch

16
00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:34.970
off in its settings?

17
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.760
Many apps and chatbots set a

18
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.840
minimum age, often thirteen.

19
00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:43.490
Younger teens usually need a

20
00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:44.250
parent’s permission.

21
00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:47.030
A free app has to pay for itself

22
00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.550
somehow, and often that’s with data.

23
00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.970
So sign pupils up with school accounts,

24
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:54.970
never their personal phone numbers.

25
00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.580
A permission is an app asking to use part

26
00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:02.380
of your phone: the camera, the microphone,

27
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.600
your contacts or your location.

28
00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.100
Allow only what the app

29
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.180
really needs to do its job.

30
00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:12.840
Choose “only while using the app”, and

31
00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.540
approximate location when you can.

32
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.720
It’s like a plumber visiting the school.

33
00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.970
He needs the tap, not the office

34
00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.770
keys or the staff register.

35
00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.290
You give each visitor only the

36
00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.570
rooms their job needs.

37
00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:28.380
Quick check!

38
00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.600
A free quiz app asks for location,

39
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.500
contacts and the microphone.

40
00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.240
It only shows quiz questions.

41
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.080
What do you allow?

42
00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:40.100
None of them.

43
00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:43.550
A quiz needs none of those to work, and

44
00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:45.450
you can say no and still use it.

45
00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:47.950
If an app won’t work without permissions

46
00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:50.390
it doesn’t need, choose another app.

47
00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.130
AI chatbots need extra care.

48
00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.590
Never paste pupils’ names, marks,

49
00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:00.390
health or behaviour notes into one.

50
00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:04.300
Write “Pupil A” instead, and change any

51
00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.240
detail that could identify a child.

52
00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.690
Check its settings too: many let you stop

53
00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.750
your chats being used to train the AI.

54
00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.860
Shared computers need care too, in

55
00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.080
the staff room or a cyber café.

56
00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:20.190
Use a private window.

57
00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:22.400
Never tick “remember me”.

58
00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.330
And always sign out before you leave.

59
00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.860
In the lab, four new apps

60
00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:29.800
ask for permissions.

61
00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:33.060
Allow only what each one really

62
00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:35.420
needs, and learn the warning signs.

63
00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:37.310
Your turn.

64
00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:41.740
A teacher asks an AI tool to help write a

65
00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:44.940
report on a pupil, and pastes in the

66
00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:47.280
pupil’s full name and medical notes.

67
00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:50.050
Safe, or not safe?

68
00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.140
Not safe: health details are sensitive, so

69
00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.980
leave out the name and the medical notes.

70
00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.400
Remember: ask four questions first,

71
00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:03.640
allow only what an app needs, keep

72
00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:06.400
pupils anonymous in AI tools, and

73
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.060
sign out of shared computers.

74
00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:11.540
Try it in class tomorrow: draw

75
00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.580
four apps on the board, a torch, a

76
00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.700
map, a quiz and a camera.

77
00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:19.560
Pupils decide which permissions each

78
00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:22.240
one really needs, and explain why.
